# TIER-Plus — Conference Briefing Note
**How to use this:** Section 1–3 are your talking points. Section 4 is the "how does it actually work" answer for anyone who pushes. Section 5 is the set of questions that *will* get asked and where the honest answer is "yes, that's a known behaviour, here's why." Section 6 is what to say when someone asks what it can't do.
